*  Control for ev_code_end_terminates: SAME fragment, SAME :(END) exit,
*  entered by an ORDINARY label goto instead of the direct form — so the
*  direct-goto grammar is not in the picture at all.  Crashes identically
*  in mode-4, which is what proves the defect is the fragment's exit.
        C = CODE("INSIDE OUTPUT = 'in fragment' :(END)")
        OUTPUT = 'before'                       :(INSIDE)
END
